  PRIMARY METRICS — Intrinsic Learnability
================================================================================

  Lower Oracle Loss -> more predictable.  Higher Improvement -> stronger signal.

  Pattern                      Oracle Loss    Random    Gzip   Improvement
                              (best possible) (uniform)   Ratio (Random÷Oracle)
